          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 02 2024 18:47:05 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Easy. Multi-functional. Convenient.</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Gynnie combines the durability and features of our standard stretcher with OB/GYN functionality. This multi-functional stretcher is ideal for pelvic exams and can also be utilized for general use.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Pelvic exam conversion in 3 easy steps</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">4&quot; Ultra Comfort support surface</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Retractable Fifth wheel&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 18:48:06 GMT+0000",
